~ start
Nathan: [[Hi|Hello|Howdy]], this is some dialogue.
Nathan: Here are some choices.
- First one
	Nathan: You picked the first one.
- Second one
	Nathan: You picked the second one.
- Start again => start
- End the conversation => END
Nathan: For more information see the online documentation.
=> END

~ t1
YO! LUNACY!
Let us get through this quick. I have to finish this game after all.
=> END

~ t2
You can move the camera with WASD buttons.
=> END

~ t3
You can rotate it with Q and R buttons or by holding the middle mouse button.
=> END

~ t4
Try zooming with the mouse wheel.
=> END

~ t5
The green zone is the entrance to the map. Click it, then select the character that you want to enter.
=> END

~ t6
Click on character to open his action menu. Then click on the move button.
=> END

~ t7
Blue zones represent where this character can go. Select one near an enemy.
=> END

~ t8
Now select character again and choose attack.
=> END

~ t9
Red zones under enemies show who you can target with a basic attack. Press ESC to cancel the attack, open the skill menu, and choose Slash.
=> END

~ t10
This skill is bound to character and will rotate with him. Cancel it and choose Blast.
=> END

~ t11
This one is unbound. Blue zones show where it can be cast. You can rotate unbound spells by pressing R. Now choose where to cast it.
=> END

~ t12
Now press ESC to open the turn menu and press the execute button.
=> END

~ t13
With this, every action you chose is sealed. Open the turn menu and end the turn.
=> END

~ t14
If you made a wrong move or want to cancel an attack or skill before execution, move the selector over character and press Z.
=> END

~ t15
Some maps require to kill all enemies. Some to reach a certain zone.
With this tutorial is concluded. Good luck!
=> END
